<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21893" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γενικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>belonging to</i> or <i>connected with the</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γένος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Top.</u>
				102a36
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ διαφορὰ γ.</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				101b18
			</span></i>; <i>generic</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Chrysipp.Stoic.
				2.28
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Sign.</u>
				18
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				19
			</span></i>,etc.: 
				Comp.
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Stoic.</u>
				2.117
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ptol.
				<u>Phas.</u>
				p.5
			</span></i> H.: 
				Sup.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Diog.
			</span></i> Bab.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Stoic.</u>
				3.214
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				282.19
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>, etc. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					M.Ant.
					8.55
				</span></i>
			, 
			<i><span class="en">
				Plot.
				6.1.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>in Nic.</u>
				p.22
			</span></i> P., etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>principal, typical</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀρχήσεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Salt.</u>
					34
				</span></i>
			 (
				Comp.
			), cf. <i><span class="en">
				22
			</span></i> (
				Sup.
			). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>consisting of families</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φυλαί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					4.14
				</span></i>
			, etc.; <i>of the family</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νόμος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>CIG</u>
					3467.54
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Sardis</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				2712
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Mylasa</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>sexual</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁμάρτημα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdn.
					6.1.5
				</span></i>
			 (dub.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>in kind</i>, opp. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀργυρικός, λόγος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PFlor.</u>
					77.7
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii A. D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>V.</b> Gramm., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ γενική</span> (sc.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πτῶσις</span>) <i>genitive case,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Stoic.
				2.59
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.T.
				636
			</span></i>, etc.</div>
